WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Deep in the cosmos, a new era of discovery begins.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The James Webb Space Telescope peers into the cosmic dawn.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Revealing light from the very first stars and galaxies.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Peering through dust clouds into cosmic nurseries where stars are born.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Pushing the boundaries of what humanity can observe across space and time.
